' UXClazz source example. It is transformed before uxb.exe sees it.
CLAZZ DATA FishSample
    DERIVE EQ, HASH, CLONE, TOSTRING, JSON
    DECORATOR Validated
    Code AS STRING
    Length AS F64
    Weight AS F64
    Alive AS BOOLEAN
END CLAZZ

CLAZZ ENTITY Customer
    DERIVE EQ, HASH, CLONE, TOSTRING, JSON
    READONLY Name AS STRING
END CLAZZ
